### Cash – confirmed immediately
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Chintu Jobs",
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10",
  "endDate": "2026-12-12",
  "roomSegment": "LARGE",
  "paymentMode": "CASH"
}

### Credit card – confirmed (WireMock returns CONFIRMED)
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Sam Joes",
  "roomNumber": "102",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10",
  "endDate": "2026-12-12",
  "roomSegment": "SMALL",
  "paymentMode": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "paymentReference": "DL123456789"
}

### Credit card – rejected (reference starting with REJ) -> 422
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Diana Parker",
  "roomNumber": "103",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10",
  "endDate": "2026-12-12",
  "roomSegment": "SMALL",
  "paymentMode": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "paymentReference": "REJ0001"
}

### Bank transfer – PENDING_PAYMENT
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ammu Rabi",
  "roomNumber": "201",
  "startDate": "2026-12-20",
  "endDate": "2026-12-23",
  "roomSegment": "EXTRA_LARGE",
  "paymentMode": "BANK_TRANSFER"
}

### More than 30 days -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Chinna Jhon",
  "roomNumber": "202",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01",
  "endDate": "2027-01-05",
  "roomSegment": "MEDIUM",
  "paymentMode": "CASH"
}

### Get reservation
GET http://localhost:8080/reservations/{{reservationId}}
